This is an Indobase Shop template (ecommerce starter) using @indobaseinc/indobase-js.
- Keep src/lib/indobase.ts as the single client entry point.
- Auth: email/password signup and signin via GoTrue on the linked Indobase project.
- Shop: product catalog, cart, and checkout flow using Indobase Postgres (products, orders tables with RLS).
- Provide SQL migrations for products and orders; wire cart to authenticated users.
- Customize branding; use @indobaseinc/indobase-js only via src/lib/indobase.ts.
- Run npm install && npm run dev after import. Vite preview on port 5173.
